const nav=[["dashboard","Dashboard",Home],["grocery","Grocery List",ShoppingBag],["recipes","Recipes",ChefHat],["workouts","Workouts",Activity],["shop","Shop",ShoppingBag],["settings","Settings",Settings]] as const;
const load=<T,>(k:string,d:T):T=>{try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(k)||"") as T}catch{return d}};
export default function App(){
 const[page,setPage]=useState<Page>("dashboard"); const[favs,setFavs]=useState<string[]>(()=>load("sg-favs",[])); const[groceryRecipes,setGroceryRecipes]=useState<string[]>(()=>{const v=load<unknown>("sg-grocery-recipes",[]);return Array.isArray(v)?v.filter((x):x is string=>typeof x==="string"):[]}); const[checkedGroceries,setCheckedGroceries]=useState<string[]>(()=>{const v=load<unknown>("sg-grocery-checked",[]);return Array.isArray(v)?v.filter((x):x is string=>typeof x==="string"):[]}); const[unlocked,setUnlocked]=useState<string[]>(()=>load("sg-unlocked",[])); const[plan,setPlan]=useState<Planned[]>(()=>load("sg-plan",[])); const[workouts,setWorkouts]=useState<WorkoutDone[]>(()=>load("sg-workouts",[])); const[selected,setSelected]=useState<Recipe|null>(null); const[profile,setProfile]=useState<Profile>(()=>load("sg-profile",{age:28,sex:"Male",height:175,weight:78,activity:1.375,goal:"Maintain"}));
 useEffect(()=>localStorage.setItem("sg-favs",JSON.stringify(favs)),[favs]); useEffect(()=>localStorage.setItem("sg-grocery-recipes",JSON.stringify(groceryRecipes)),[groceryRecipes]); useEffect(()=>localStorage.setItem("sg-grocery-checked",JSON.stringify(checkedGroceries)),[checkedGroceries]); useEffect(()=>localStorage.setItem("sg-unlocked",JSON.stringify(unlocked)),[unlocked]); useEffect(()=>localStorage.setItem("sg-plan",JSON.stringify(plan)),[plan]); useEffect(()=>localStorage.setItem("sg-workouts",JSON.stringify(workouts)),[workouts]); useEffect(()=>localStorage.setItem("sg-profile",JSON.stringify(profile)),[profile]);
 const title=nav.find(n=>n[0]===page)?.[1]??"Smart Grocery";
 return <div className="app"><aside><div className="brand"><span>SG</span><div>SMART<br/><b>GROCERY</b></div></div><nav>{nav.map(([id,label,Icon])=><button className={page===id?"active":""} onClick={()=>setPage(id)} key={id}><Icon size={19}/>{label}</button>)}</nav><div className="sideNote"><ChefHat size={18}/><b>62 verified recipes</b><small>Verified recipes ready for your routine.</small></div></aside><main><header><div><small>SMART GROCERY US</small><h1>{title}</h1></div><div className="avatar">K</div></header>
 {page==="dashboard"&&<Dashboard plan={plan} workouts={workouts} favs={favs.length}/>}
 {page==="grocery"&&<GroceryList selected={groceryRecipes} setSelected={setGroceryRecipes} checked={checkedGroceries} setChecked={setCheckedGroceries} open={setSelected}/>}
 {page==="recipes"&&<Recipes favs={favs} setFavs={setFavs} unlocked={unlocked} plan={plan} setPlan={setPlan} open={setSelected}/>}
 {page==="workouts"&&<Workouts done={workouts} setDone={setWorkouts} goal={profile.goal}/>}
 {page==="shop"&&<Shop unlocked={unlocked} setUnlocked={setUnlocked}/>}
 {page==="settings"&&<SettingsPage/>}
 </main><div className="mobileNav">{nav.map(([id,,Icon])=><button className={page===id?"active":""} onClick={()=>setPage(id)} key={id}><Icon size={20}/></button>)}</div>
 {selected&&<RecipeModal recipe={selected} unlocked={selected.free||unlocked.includes(selected.id)} close={()=>setSelected(null)} add={()=>{setPlan(p=>[...p,{id:crypto.randomUUID(),recipeId:selected.id,day:new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10),cooked:false}]);setSelected(null)}}/>}</div>
}
function Dashboard({plan,workouts,favs}:{plan:Planned[];workouts:WorkoutDone[];favs:number}){const cooked=plan.filter(x=>x.cooked);const days=new Set([...cooked.map(x=>x.day),...workouts.map(x=>x.day)]).size;return <><section className="hero"><div><span className="eyebrow">YOUR HEALTHY ROUTINE</span><h2>Eat smarter.<br/><em>Feel stronger.</em></h2><p>Plan healthy meals, discover fitness recipes and keep your week moving.</p></div><div className="heroPlate">🥗<span>62<br/><b>RECIPES</b></span></div></section><div className="stats">{[["Meals Prepared",cooked.length,UtensilsCrossed],["Workouts",workouts.length,Activity],["Active Days",days,Activity],["Favorites",favs,Heart]].map(([a,b,I]:any)=><div className="stat" key={a}><I size={20}/><small>{a}</small><strong>{b}</strong></div>)}</div><section className="panel"><div className="sectionHead"><div><small>THIS WEEK</small><h3>Weekly Progress</h3></div><span>{cooked.length+workouts.length} activities</span></div>{cooked.length+workouts.length?<div className="progressList">{[...cooked.map(x=>({id:x.id,name:recipes.find(r=>r.id===x.recipeId)?.name||"Meal",day:x.day})),...workouts].slice(-5).reverse().map(x=><div key={x.id}><Check size={17}/><span>{x.name}</span><b>{x.day}</b></div>)}</div>:<div className="emptyChart"><Activity size={28}/><b>Your progress starts here</b><p>Mark a planned meal as prepared and your progress will appear here.</p></div>}</section></>}
function nutritionTarget(p:Profile){const age=Math.max(18,Number(p.age)||18),height=Math.max(120,Number(p.height)||120),weight=Math.max(35,Number(p.weight)||35),activity=Number(p.activity)||1.2;const bmr=10*weight+6.25*height-5*age+(p.sex==="Male"?5:-161);const maintenance=bmr*activity;const cal=Math.max(p.sex==="Female"?1200:1500,Math.round(maintenance+(p.goal==="Lose Weight"?-400:p.goal==="Gain Muscle"?300:0)));const split=p.goal==="Lose Weight"?{protein:.30,fat:.30,carbs:.40}:p.goal==="Gain Muscle"?{protein:.25,fat:.25,carbs:.50}:{protein:.25,fat:.30,carbs:.45};const protein=Math.round(cal*split.protein/4);const carbs=Math.round(cal*split.carbs/4);const fat=Math.round(cal*split.fat/9);return{cal,protein,carbs,fat}}
function TodayPlanner({plan,setPlan,open}:{plan:Planned[];setPlan:(p:Planned[])=>void;open:(r:Recipe)=>void}){const today=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10);const todayPlan=plan.filter(x=>x.day===today);const groups=[["Light Meal",["Breakfast","Afternoon Snack","Light Meal"]],["Lunch",["Lunch","Salads","Healthy Pasta"]],["Dinner",["Dinner"]],["Dessert",["Healthy Desserts"]]] as const;const pick=(cats:readonly string[],avoid:string[]=[])=>{const pool=recipes.filter(r=>cats.includes(r.category)&&!avoid.includes(r.id));return pool[Math.floor(Math.random()*pool.length)]};const generate=()=>{const ids:string[]=[];groups.forEach(([,cats])=>{const r=pick(cats,ids);if(r)ids.push(r.id)});setPlan([...plan.filter(x=>x.day!==today),...ids.map(id=>({id:crypto.randomUUID(),recipeId:id,day:today,cooked:false}))])};const replace=(p:Planned,cats:readonly string[])=>{const pool=recipes.filter(r=>cats.includes(r.category));if(pool.length<2)return;const current=pool.findIndex(r=>r.id===p.recipeId);const r=pool[(current+1)%pool.length];setPlan(plan.map(x=>x.id===p.id?{...x,recipeId:r.id}:x))};const chosen=todayPlan.map(x=>recipes.find(r=>r.id===x.recipeId)).filter(Boolean) as Recipe[];const totals=chosen.reduce((a,r)=>({cal:a.cal+(Number(r.cal)||0),protein:a.protein+(Number(r.protein)||0),carbs:a.carbs+(Number(r.carbs)||0),fat:a.fat+(Number(r.fat)||0)}),{cal:0,protein:0,carbs:0,fat:0});return <><section className="intro"><span className="eyebrow">TODAY'S MENU</span><h2>What to Eat Today</h2><p>Get four meal ideas for your day. Replace any meal you want and your daily nutrition totals update automatically.</p></section><section className="panel todaySummary"><div className="sectionHead"><div><small>4 MEALS • DAILY TOTAL</small><h3>{todayPlan.length?"Your menu today":"Generate today's menu"}</h3></div><button className="primary" onClick={generate}>{todayPlan.length?"✨ Generate New Day":"✨ Build Today's Menu"}</button></div>{todayPlan.length>0?<div className="stats dailyNutrition"><div className="stat"><small>Calories</small><strong>{Math.round(totals.cal)}</strong><span>kcal</span></div><div className="stat"><small>Protein</small><strong>{Math.round(totals.protein)}g</strong><span>daily total</span></div><div className="stat"><small>Carbs</small><strong>{Math.round(totals.carbs)}g</strong><span>daily total</span></div><div className="stat"><small>Fat</small><strong>{Math.round(totals.fat)}g</strong><span>daily total</span></div></div>:<p className="disclaimer">We’ll combine one Light Meal, Lunch, Dinner and Dessert from your recipe collection.</p>}</section>{todayPlan.length>0&&<section className="panel"><div className="sectionHead"><div><small>TODAY'S 4 MEALS</small><h3>Your daily menu</h3></div><span>{todayPlan.length} meals</span></div><div className="recipeGrid">{groups.map(([label,cats],idx)=>{const p=todayPlan[idx];const r=p&&recipes.find(x=>x.id===p.recipeId);return r?<article className="recipe" key={p.id}><div className="food photoFood" onClick={()=>open(r)}><RecipePhoto recipe={r}/><span className="freeTag">{label}</span></div><div className="recipeBody"><small>{r.category}</small><h3>{r.name}</h3><div className="macros"><span><Timer size={14}/>{r.time} min</span><span><b>{r.cal}</b> kcal</span></div><div className="macroLine macroThree"><span><b>{r.protein}g</b> Protein</span><span><b>{r.carbs}g</b> Carbs</span><span><b>{r.fat??0}g</b> Fat</span></div><button className="cardAction" onClick={()=>replace(p,cats)}>↻ Replace Meal</button><button className="cardAction" onClick={()=>open(r)}>View recipe</button></div></article>:null})}</div></section>}</>}
function GroceryList({selected,setSelected,checked,setChecked}:{selected:string[];setSelected:(x:string[])=>void;checked:string[];setChecked:(x:string[])=>void;open:(r:Recipe)=>void}){
 const[generated,setGenerated]=useState(false);
 const clean=(raw:string)=>{
  let name=String(raw||"").trim();
  name=name.replace(/^\s*[\d\s\/\.½¼¾⅓⅔⅛⅜⅝⅞-]+\s*/,"");
  name=name.replace(/^\s*(cups?|tbsp|tablespoons?|tsp|teaspoons?|lbs?|pounds?|oz|ounces?|grams?|g|kg|ml|liters?|l)\b\s*/i,"");
  name=name.split(",")[0].trim();
  return name||String(raw||"").trim();
 };
 const chosen=recipes.filter(r=>selected.includes(r.id));
 const ingredientNames:string[]=[];
 chosen.forEach(r=>{(r.ingredients||[]).forEach(raw=>{const name=clean(raw);if(name&&!ingredientNames.some(x=>x.toLowerCase()===name.toLowerCase()))ingredientNames.push(name)})});
 const changeSelection=(id:string)=>{
  setGenerated(false);
  setChecked([]);
  setSelected([id]);
 };
 const toggle=(name:string)=>setChecked(checked.includes(name)?checked.filter(x=>x!==name):checked.concat(name));
 return <><section className="intro"><span className="eyebrow">SHOP SMARTER</span><h2>Grocery List</h2><p>Choose one recipe and generate its supermarket checklist.</p></section>
 {!generated&&<section className="panel"><div className="sectionHead"><div><small>SELECT A RECIPE</small><h3>What do you want to cook?</h3></div><span>{selected.length?"1 selected":"Select one"}</span></div><div className="groceryRecipePicker">{recipes.map(r=><button type="button" key={r.id} className={"groceryRecipeChoice "+(selected.includes(r.id)?"selected":"")} onClick={()=>changeSelection(r.id)}><RecipePhoto recipe={r}/><span><b>{r.name}</b><small>{r.category} · {(r.ingredients||[]).length} ingredients</small></span><em>{selected.includes(r.id)?"✓":"+"}</em></button>)}</div>{selected.length>0&&<div className="generateGroceryBar"><div><b>1 recipe selected</b><small>Generate your shopping list.</small></div><button className="primary" type="button" onClick={()=>setGenerated(true)}>✓ Generate Grocery List</button></div>}</section>}
 {generated&&selected.length>0&&<section className="rainbowGroceryCard"><div className="rainbowInner"><div className="shoppingListHead"><div><small>SUPERMARKET CHECKLIST</small><h2>Grocery List</h2></div><div className="groceryActions"><button type="button" className="cardAction" onClick={()=>setGenerated(false)}>← Choose Another Recipe</button><button type="button" className="cardAction" onClick={()=>setChecked([])}>Clear Checks</button></div></div><div className="grocerySingleList"><h3>INGREDIENTS</h3>{ingredientNames.map(name=><label className={"groceryItem "+(checked.includes(name)?"done":"")} key={name.toLowerCase()}><input type="checkbox" checked={checked.includes(name)} onChange={()=>toggle(name)}/><span><b>{name}</b></span></label>)}</div></div></section>}</>
}

function MyRecipes({unlocked,favs,setFavs,open}:{unlocked:string[];favs:string[];setFavs:(x:string[])=>void;open:(r:Recipe)=>void}){const[q,setQ]=useState("");const owned=recipes.filter(r=>(r.free||unlocked.includes(r.id))&&r.name.toLowerCase().includes(q.toLowerCase()));return <><section className="intro"><span className="eyebrow">YOUR COLLECTION</span><h2>My Recipes</h2><p>Your verified recipes in one place.</p></section><div className="search"><Search size={18}/><input placeholder="Search my recipes..." value={q} onChange={e=>setQ(e.target.value)}/></div><div className="ownedSummary"><b>{owned.length}</b><span>recipes in your collection</span></div><div className="recipeGrid">{owned.map(r=><article className="recipe" key={r.id}><div className="food photoFood" onClick={()=>open(r)}><RecipePhoto recipe={r}/><button className="heart" onClick={e=>{e.stopPropagation();setFavs(favs.includes(r.id)?favs.filter(x=>x!==r.id):[...favs,r.id])}}><Heart size={18} fill={favs.includes(r.id)?"currentColor":"none"}/></button><span className="freeTag">{r.free?"OWNED":"PURCHASED"}</span></div><div className="recipeBody"><small>{r.category}</small><h3>{r.name}</h3><div className="macros"><span><Timer size={14}/>{r.time} min</span><span><b>{r.cal}</b> kcal</span></div><div className="macroLine macroThree"><span><b>{r.protein}g</b> Protein</span><span><b>{r.carbs}g</b> Carbs</span><span><b>{r.fat??0}g</b> Fat</span></div><button className="cardAction" onClick={()=>open(r)}>View recipe</button></div></article>)}</div></>}
function Recipes({favs,setFavs,unlocked,plan,setPlan,open}:{favs:string[];setFavs:(x:string[])=>void;unlocked:string[];plan:Planned[];setPlan:(x:Planned[])=>void;open:(r:Recipe)=>void}){const[q,setQ]=useState("");const[filter,setFilter]=useState("");const categoryMap:Record<string,string[]>={
"Light Meals":["Breakfast","Afternoon Snack","Light Meal"],
"Lunches":["Lunch","Salads","Healthy Pasta"],
"Dinners":["Dinner"],
"Desserts":["Healthy Desserts"],
"Drinks":["Smoothies & Shakes"]
};const filtered=filter?recipes.filter(r=>r.name.toLowerCase().includes(q.toLowerCase())&&(categoryMap[filter]?.includes(r.category)||r.category===filter)):[];const categoryCards=[
["Light Meals","Light meals for any time","01-healthy-breakfast.png"],
["Lunches","Fresh & balanced","02-healthy-lunches.png"],
["Dinners","Simple & satisfying","03-healthy-dinners.png"],
["Desserts","Sweet, lighter choices","05-healthy-desserts.png"],
["Drinks","Smoothies & shakes","06-healthy-drinks.png"]
];return <><section className="intro"><span className="eyebrow">HEALTHY, NOT BORING</span><h2>Recipes for your routine.</h2><p>Verified recipes with complete ingredients, nutrition facts and preparation.</p></section><div className="categoryShowcase">{categoryCards.map(([name,subtitle,img])=><button key={name} className={"categoryBanner "+(filter===name?"active":"")} onClick={()=>{setFilter(filter===name?"":name);setQ("")}}><span className="categoryShade"></span><span className="categoryCopy"><b>{name}</b><small>{subtitle}</small></span></button>)}</div>{filter&&<><div className="selectedCategoryHead"><div><small>SELECTED CATEGORY</small><h3>{filter}</h3></div><button onClick={()=>{setFilter("");setQ("")}}>Back to categories</button></div><div className="search"><Search size={18}/><input placeholder={"Search in "+filter+"..."} value={q} onChange={e=>setQ(e.target.value)}/></div><div className="recipeGrid">{filtered.map(r=>{const access=r.free||unlocked.includes(r.id);return <article className="recipe" key={r.id}><div className="food photoFood" onClick={()=>access&&open(r)}><RecipePhoto recipe={r}/><button className="heart" onClick={e=>{e.stopPropagation();setFavs(favs.includes(r.id)?favs.filter(x=>x!==r.id):[...favs,r.id])}}><Heart size={18} fill={favs.includes(r.id)?"currentColor":"none"}/></button>{r.free?<span className="freeTag">FREE</span>:!access?<span className="lock"><LockKeyhole size={14}/> $2.00</span>:<span className="freeTag">UNLOCKED</span>}</div><div className="recipeBody"><small>{r.category}</small><h3>{r.name}</h3><div className="macros"><span><Timer size={14}/>{r.time} min</span><span><b>{r.cal}</b> kcal</span></div><div className="macroLine macroThree"><span><b>{r.protein}g</b> Protein</span><span><b>{r.carbs}g</b> Carbs</span><span><b>{r.fat??0}g</b> Fat</span></div>{access?<button className="cardAction" onClick={()=>open(r)}>View recipe</button>:<button className="cardAction locked">Unlock · $2.00</button>}</div></article>})}</div></>}</>};

function Workouts({done,setDone,goal}:{done:WorkoutDone[];setDone:(x:WorkoutDone[])=>void;goal:Profile["goal"]}){const[place,setPlace]=useState("Gym");const[level,setLevel]=useState("Beginner");const plans:{[k:string]:string[]}={Gym:["Goblet Squat · 3 × 10","Chest Press · 3 × 10","Lat Pulldown · 3 × 12","Romanian Deadlift · 3 × 10","Incline Walk · 12 min"],Home:["Bodyweight Squat · 3 × 15","Push-ups · 3 × 8–12","Reverse Lunges · 3 × 10/side","Glute Bridge · 3 × 15","Mountain Climbers · 3 × 30 sec"]};const name=`${place} · ${goal} · ${level}`;const today=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10);const completed=done.some(x=>x.day===today&&x.name===name);const intensity=level==="Beginner"?"Foundation":level==="Intermediate"?"Progressive":"High intensity";return <><section className="intro"><span className="eyebrow">TRAIN YOUR WAY</span><h2>Build your workout.</h2><p>Choose what you want to achieve, where you train and your current experience level.</p></section><div className="workoutGoalSummary"><div><span>YOUR CURRENT GOAL</span><b>{goal}</b><small>Synced automatically from What to Eat Today.</small></div><em>{goal==="Lose Weight"?"🔥":goal==="Gain Muscle"?"💪":"⚖️"}</em></div><section className="workoutBuilder"><div className="choiceSection"><div><small>STEP 1</small><h3>Where are you training today?</h3><p>We'll use exercises that fit the equipment available to you.</p></div><div className="trainingPlaceCards">{[["Gym","🏋️","Full equipment","Machines, cables and free weights."],["Home","🏠","No gym needed","Bodyweight-focused and easy to start."]].map(([v,icon,badge,desc])=><button key={v} className={"placeCard "+(place===v?"selected":"")} onClick={()=>setPlace(v)}><i>{icon}</i><div><span>{badge}</span><b>{v}</b><small>{desc}</small></div><em>{place===v?"✓":""}</em></button>)}</div></div><div className="choiceSection"><div><small>STEP 2</small><h3>What is your training experience?</h3><p>Select the level that best reflects your current training experience.</p></div><div className="levelCards">{[["Beginner","Start strong","Simple movements and manageable volume."],["Intermediate","Build momentum","More training volume and progression."],["Advanced","Push further","Designed for experienced trainees and higher effort."]].map(([v,badge,desc])=><button key={v} className={"levelCard "+(level===v?"selected":"")} onClick={()=>setLevel(v)}><b>{v}</b><span>{badge}</span><small>{desc}</small>{level===v&&<em>✓</em>}</button>)}</div></div></section><section className="panel workoutCard workoutResult"><div className="workoutResultTop"><div><span className="eyebrow">TODAY'S WORKOUT</span><h3>{goal}</h3><p>{place} training · {level} · {intensity}</p></div><div className="workoutBadge">{place==="Gym"?"🏋️":"🏠"}<small>{place}</small></div></div><div className="workoutHighlights"><span><b>{plans[place].length}</b><small>Exercises</small></span><span><b>{level==="Beginner"?"35":"45"}</b><small>Est. minutes</small></span><span><b>60–90s</b><small>Rest</small></span></div><div className="exerciseList">{plans[place].map((x,i)=><div key={x}><b>{String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")}</b><span>{x}<small>{i===plans[place].length-1?" Finish strong and keep a controlled pace.":" Focus on controlled form and steady breathing."}</small></span></div>)}</div><button className="primary" disabled={completed} onClick={()=>!completed&&setDone([...done,{id:crypto.randomUUID(),day:today,name}])}>{completed?"Workout completed ✓":"Complete Workout"}</button><p className="disclaimer">Adjust load, range of motion and exercise selection to your ability. Stop if you feel pain. This routine is general fitness information, not medical advice.</p></section></>}function Shop({unlocked,setUnlocked}:{unlocked:string[];setUnlocked:(x:string[])=>void}){const packs=[["1 Recipe","$2.00",1],["3 Recipes","$5.50",3],["5 Recipes","$8.50",5],["10 Recipes","$15.00",10],["20 Recipes","$27.00",20]] as const;const locked=recipes.filter(r=>!r.free&&!unlocked.includes(r.id));return <><section className="intro"><span className="eyebrow">RECIPE SHOP</span><h2>More recipes. Better value.</h2><p>No subscription required. Choose individual recipes or save with a pack.</p></section><div className="packGrid">{packs.map((p,i)=><div className={"pack "+(i===3?"featured":"")} key={p[0]}>{i===3&&<span className="best">POPULAR</span>}<ShoppingBag/><h3>{p[0]}</h3><strong>{p[1]}</strong><p>One-time purchase</p><button className="secondary" onClick={()=>{const next=locked.slice(0,p[2]).map(r=>r.id);setUnlocked([...new Set([...unlocked,...next])])}}>Simulate unlock</button></div>)}</div><section className="panel shopInfo"><h3>How recipe packs work</h3><p>After checkout is connected, a pack will give you recipe credits. You'll choose exactly which premium recipes you want to unlock. The buttons above currently simulate that flow for testing.</p></section></>}
function recipeDescription(r:Recipe){const lead:Record<string,string>={"Breakfast":"A balanced breakfast built for steady energy and an easy start to the day.","Lunch":"A satisfying lunch with a practical balance of protein, carbohydrates and vegetables.","Dinner":"A complete dinner designed to be flavorful, filling and simple enough for your routine.","Afternoon Snack":"A quick snack that adds flavor and useful nutrients between meals.","Salads":"A fresh, colorful bowl with protein, vegetables and a light finish.","Healthy Pasta":"Comforting pasta with a lighter, protein-focused approach.","Smoothies & Shakes":"A cold, creamy blend that is fast to prepare and easy to fit into a busy day.","Healthy Desserts":"A lighter sweet option made for portion-conscious enjoyment.","Healthy Cakes":"A softer, lighter cake option made with everyday ingredients.","Fitness Breads":"A practical homemade bread option for breakfasts and snacks."};return lead[r.category]||"A practical healthy recipe for your routine."}
function detailedSteps(r:Recipe){if(r.steps.length>=5)return r.steps;const ing=r.ingredients;const base=[`Measure every ingredient before starting. Wash produce and prepare the work surface.`,`Prepare the main ingredients: ${ing.slice(0,2).join(" and ")}. Cut, mash, whisk or season as appropriate for the recipe.`,r.steps[0]||"Combine the prepared ingredients in the order listed.",r.steps[1]||"Cook or assemble until the texture and doneness are right.",r.steps[2]||"Finish with the remaining ingredients, adjust seasoning and serve."];return base.slice(0,5)}
function recipeTip(r:Recipe){if(r.category.includes("Smooth"))return "For a thicker shake, use frozen fruit and reduce the liquid slightly. Add ice only after blending the main ingredients.";if(r.category==="Salads")return "Keep the dressing separate until serving so the vegetables stay crisp.";if(r.category.includes("Cake")||r.category.includes("Dessert"))return "Let it cool or chill before serving; the texture usually improves after resting.";if(r.category.includes("Bread"))return "Allow the bread to cool before slicing so the crumb sets and stays moist.";return "Prep vegetables and grains ahead of time to make this recipe faster on busy days."}
function RecipeModal({recipe,unlocked,close,add}:{recipe:Recipe;unlocked:boolean;close:()=>void;add:()=>void}){return <div className="modalBack" onClick={close}><div className="modal recipeDetail" onClick={e=>e.stopPropagation()}><button className="modalClose" onClick={close}>×</button><div className="detailHero photoFood"><RecipePhoto recipe={recipe}/><span className="detailCategory">{recipe.category}</span></div><div className="detailContent"><div className="detailTitle"><div><span className="eyebrow">VERIFIED RECIPE</span><h2>{recipe.name}</h2><p>{recipeDescription(recipe)}</p></div><span className="detailTime"><Timer size={16}/>{recipe.time} min total</span></div><div className="detailMacros"><span>🔥 {recipe.cal}<small>Calories</small></span><span>💪 {recipe.protein}g<small>Protein</small></span><span>🌾 {recipe.carbs}g<small>Carbs</small></span><span>💧 {recipe.fat}g<small>Total Fat</small></span></div><div className="recipeMeta"><span><b>{recipe.servings}</b><small>Servings</small></span><span><b>{recipe.prepTime} min</b><small>Prep time</small></span><span><b>{recipe.cookTime} min</b><small>Cook time</small></span></div><div className="servingBox"><b>Serving size</b><p>{recipe.servingSize}</p></div><div className="detailColumns"><section><div className="detailSectionHead"><h3>Ingredients</h3><span>{recipe.servings} servings</span></div><div className="ingredientList">{recipe.ingredients.map((x,i)=><div key={x}><b>{i+1}</b><span>{x}</span></div>)}</div></section><section><h3>Preparation</h3><div className="stepList">{recipe.steps.map((x,i)=><div key={i}><b>{i+1}</b><p>{x}</p></div>)}</div></section></div><section className="nutritionFull"><h3>Nutrition Facts <small>per serving</small></h3>{recipe.sourceUrl&&<p><a href={recipe.sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nutrition source: {recipe.sourceName}</a></p>}<div className="nutritionGrid"><span><b>{recipe.cal}</b> Calories</span><span><b>{recipe.fat}g</b> Total Fat</span><span><b>{recipe.satFat}g</b> Saturated Fat</span><span><b>{recipe.transFat}g</b> Trans Fat</span><span><b>{recipe.cholesterol}mg</b> Cholesterol</span><span><b>{recipe.sodium}mg</b> Sodium</span><span><b>{recipe.carbs}g</b> Carbohydrate</span><span><b>{recipe.fiber}g</b> Dietary Fiber</span><span><b>{recipe.sugars}g</b> Total Sugars</span><span><b>{recipe.addedSugars}g</b> Added Sugars</span><span><b>{recipe.protein}g</b> Protein</span>{recipe.potassium!==undefined&&<span><b>{recipe.potassium}mg</b> Potassium</span>}</div></section><div className="allergenBox"><b>Allergens</b><p>{recipe.allergens.length?`Contains: ${recipe.allergens.join(", ")}.`:"No major allergens identified from the listed ingredients."}</p></div><button className="primary detailAdd" onClick={add}>Add to My Planning</button></div></div></div>}
function SettingsPage(){return <section className="panel settings"><h3>Preferences</h3><label>Language<input value="English (US)" disabled/></label><label>Currency<input value="USD ($)" disabled/></label><label>Measurements<input value="US customary" disabled/></label><p>Favorites, unlocked recipes and meal planning are saved locally on this device.</p><p className="disclaimer">Nutrition facts for the current recipe are reproduced from the published recipe source. This app is not medical or dietary advice.</p></section>}
